            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "8 步流映射适配器；每步约慢 9%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A %@-bit copy beside the original: choose which one runs, and which one to keep" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 位副本与原模型并存：选择使用哪一个，以及保留哪一个"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A chat with the helper goes to a member's own helper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "与助手的对话会交给成员自己的助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A clip is read a frame at a time, 576 × 320 at most, cut into scenes where the picture changes, and each scene told in a few sentences, then the whole. More frames see more and take longer: each is about 180 of the model's words to read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "视频逐帧读取，每帧至多 576 × 320，在画面变化处切分为场景，每个场景用几句话描述，最后概括全片。帧越多看得越细，也越费时：每帧约占模型 180 个词元。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A clip's layers cannot be merged" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "视频的图层不能合并"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A composition of one layer showing it, made active: what it is changed in" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "一个只含此素材一层的合成，设为活跃：在其中修改它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A download was interrupted" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "下载中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few-step LoRA distilled from the model: picked, it runs at the steps and shifts it was made for. HyperFlow and TaoMate have switches of their own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "由模型蒸馏而来的少步 LoRA：选中后按它被训练时的步数和偏移运行。HyperFlow 与 TaoMate 有各自的开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A flat asset of it as it looks: a picture, a movie or a sound" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "按其当前外观生成的扁平素材：图片、影片或声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder of layers: drag a layer's row onto it to put it in" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "图层文件夹：将图层行拖到它上面即可放入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A job this Mac cannot run, or cannot run now because it is busy, goes to a member that can and is free — generations and the helper's prompts alike." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 无法运行的任务，或因忙碌而暂时无法运行的任务，会交给能运行且空闲的成员——生成和助手的提示词都是如此。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key is kept in your Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "钥匙串中已存有密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mask ties one of these layers to a layer outside the two" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "其中一个图层通过蒙版与另外的图层相关联"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A member keeps its context" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "成员保留其上下文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A model's own policy comes before its task's. Listed: the models on this Mac or offered by a member." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "模型自己的策略优先于其任务的策略。列出的是本机上的模型和成员提供的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new anonymous project starts once it has stopped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "停止后将开始一个新的匿名项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new composition" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "新的合成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new one starts in its place, and this one is deleted with everything in it — its results, imports and history — unless you save it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "一个新的匿名项目会取而代之，而这个项目及其中的一切——结果、导入的素材和历史记录——都会被删除，除非你保存它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new, blank asset: a composition (a timeline), a still composition, or audio to record into" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "新建空白素材：合成（时间线）、静态合成，或用于录音的音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A permission changed in System Settings takes effect when Valtz is opened again for screen and system audio recording; the others at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "在“系统设置”中更改的权限：屏幕与系统录音在重新打开 Valtz 后生效，其余立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A photo or a video taken with the camera: the prompt's paperclip › Take a Photo or Video…." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "用相机拍摄的照片或视频：提示词的回形针 › 拍摄照片或视频…。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture or a clip on the stage has layers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "舞台上的图片或视频有图层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A scale a row and a token, rotated: the fastest" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每行、每个 token 一个尺度，先旋转：最快"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A semitone higher" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "升高一个半音"
