    "By default a job this Mac cannot run, or cannot run now because it is busy, goes to a member that can and is free — generations and the helper's prompts alike. Offload Policies set it task by task." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "默认情况下，本机无法运行或因忙碌暂时无法运行的任务，会交给能运行且空闲的成员——生成和助手的提示都是如此。分流策略可按任务设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
