    "Chords" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "和弦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Classifier-free guidance: each step runs the model twice, with the prompt and with an empty one, and moves the picture away from the empty one's by this much. MOSS-Image's own setting is 3. Higher follows the words more literally, with harder colours; 1 runs one forward a step, about twice as fast, the prompt followed less." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "无分类器引导：每一步运行模型两次，一次带提示词、一次为空提示词，并按此强度让画面远离空提示词的结果。MOSS-Image 默认值为 3。数值越高越贴合文字，色彩也越硬；设为 1 时每步只运行一次前向，速度约快一倍，但更少遵循提示词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
