    "Click to place points the curve passes through, ⌥-click for a corner; click the first point to close it, Return to end it. On a selected path: click its curve to add a point, double-click a point to switch it between smooth and corner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "点按放置曲线经过的点，按住 ⌥ 点按放置角点；点按第一个点闭合路径，按 Return 结束。在选中的路径上：点按曲线添加点，连按一个点使其在平滑点与角点之间切换。"
