    "Corrects each restored frame's colour toward its source frame, so the upscaled layer keeps the colours of the clip it replaces. FlashVSR 1.1 moves each channel's mean and spread to the source's (AdaIN); FlashVSR+ takes the source's low frequencies and keeps its own detail (a wavelet fix)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "把每个修复后的帧的色彩校正到其源帧，使放大后的图层保持它所替换的视频片段的色彩。FlashVSR 1.1 把每个通道的均值和离散度调到源帧的数值（AdaIN）；FlashVSR+ 取源帧的低频部分，保留自身的细节（小波校正）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
