          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop LoRA, DiT or VAE weights on this panel: .safetensors files or folders, or a Draw Things .ckpt of a DiT." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将 LoRA、DiT 或 VAE 权重拖放到此面板：.safetensors 文件或文件夹均可，DiT 也可以是 Draw Things 的 .ckpt。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop LoRA, DiT or VAE weights on this panel: .safetensors files or folders." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将 LoRA、DiT 或 VAE 权重拖放到此面板：.safetensors 文件或文件夹均可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop a picture or a clip on a layer to show it there; clips start with the timeline. Each layer's adjustments, crop and turn are keyed on the clip's timeline: select a layer, then set its keys." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "把图片或视频拖到图层上，就在该图层上显示；视频从时间线开头播放。每个图层的调整、裁剪和旋转都在视频的时间线上设置关键帧：先选中图层，再设置它的关键帧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop an asset on the stage to put it on a new layer at the playhead, or on a layer's row to show it there. Trim sets where the selected layer starts and what of it shows; its adjustments, crop and turn are keyed from its start. A layer showing a composition decomposes from its menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将素材拖到舞台上，即可在播放头位置放到新图层上；拖到图层行上则由该图层显示它。修剪面板设置所选图层的起点和显示的范围；它的调整、裁剪和旋转从其起点开始设置关键帧。显示合成的图层可从其菜单中分解。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop files on the prompt box" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将文件拖到提示框上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
