    },
    "Dynamic int8 for the block's large matrix products, at int8 quality. Needs the M5's matrix cores." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "块内大矩阵乘法使用动态 int8，精度为 int8。需要 M5 的矩阵核心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EXIF" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "EXIF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each frame of the timeline shows the clip's frame at that moment: frames repeat or are skipped. (Rendering new frames in between is to come.)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "时间线的每一帧显示片段在那一刻的帧：帧会重复或被跳过。（在两帧之间渲染新帧将在以后提供。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each frame's colour kept to its source's" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每帧的色彩保持与源一致"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each page shows the layers on it; a new layer, or an asset dropped on the stage, goes on the page shown — a layer's menu sets its pages. Adjustments, crop and turn are keyed by page, as a clip's by frame. Export writes a file a page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每一页显示其上的图层；新图层或拖到舞台上的素材放在当前显示的页面上——图层的菜单设置它所在的页面。调整、裁剪和旋转按页设置关键帧，如同视频按帧。导出时每页写成一个文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each sound (or clip) in the prompt is a speaker's voice, in order -- the first is the first name to speak. It is cloned from its first seconds and the words said in them, which Valtz hears first when it has no transcript" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "提示中的每段声音（或视频）依次是一位说话人的嗓音——第一段属于最先说话的名字。它由开头几秒及其中所说的话克隆而来；没有转写时，Valtz 会先听写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each step that changes the document waits for your word" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每一步修改文稿的操作都要等你同意"
