        }
      }
    },
    "How fast the clip plays: 2× (or 200%) twice as fast, 0.5× half -- the clip then takes less, or more, of the timeline" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "片段播放的快慢：2×（或 200%）快一倍，0.5× 慢一半——片段在时间线上随之变短或变长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it was made" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "生成方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the clips made in this project are kept: generated, upscaled, rendered. ProRes keeps the most for editing, its sound uncompressed; HEVC takes the least room. Clips made before keep their own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "此项目中制作的片段（生成、放大、渲染）的保存方式。ProRes 为编辑保留最多细节，声音不压缩；HEVC 占用空间最少。之前制作的片段保持原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the text's lines lie in its box" : {
