    "Interpolation" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "插值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It asks you" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "它在问你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It drafts a block of words at a time, which the model checks in one pass. It holds more memory beside the model; on a Mac without much to spare, the MTP head is as fast." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "它一次起草一段词，由模型一次性校验。它在模型之外还要占用更多内存；在内存不宽裕的 Mac 上，MTP 预测头一样快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops after the step it is on" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "完成当前这一步后暂停"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Italic" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "斜体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Italic (⌘I)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "斜体（⌘I）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its %@ download is replaced by a copy of about %@, made here and checked before the download is deleted. %@ To have the original back, download it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Its %1$@ download is replaced by a copy of about %2$@, made here and checked before the download is deleted. %3$@ To have the original back, download it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "其 %@ 的下载文件将被约 %@ 的副本替换；副本在本机制作，检查无误后才会删除下载文件。%@若要恢复原模型，重新下载即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its %@ pages are saved as a file each, numbered after the name: Name-1, Name-2, …" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "它的 %@ 个页面各存为一个文件，在名称后编号：名称-1、名称-2……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its P·V in int8 too: attention about 1.18×" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "P·V 也用 int8：注意力约 1.18 倍"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its adapter for 3 steps; no streaming, no cache" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "仅用其适配器跑 3 步；不流式生成，不用缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its assets stay in the project when the folder is deleted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "删除文件夹后，其中的素材仍保留在项目中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its first result makes the project a still or a timeline. Or set it up now:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "第一个生成结果决定项目是静态还是时间线。也可以现在设置："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its gain: 0 dB as it is, −6 dB half the level, up to +12 dB" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "增益：0 dB 为原样，−6 dB 为一半电平，最高 +12 dB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its own head drafts ahead" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "由其自带的预测头提前起草"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its own length again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "恢复原本的时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its own voices" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "模型自己的嗓音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its own: put a sound in the prompt to speak in its voice" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "模型自带的嗓音：在提示中放入一段声音，即以该嗓音说话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its own: put sounds in the prompt -- one a speaker, in order -- to speak in their voices" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "模型自己的：在提示中放入声音——每位说话人一段，依次排列——即以它们的嗓音说话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its publisher asks you to accept its license on Hugging Face before you download it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "其发布者要求你先在 Hugging Face 上接受其许可，然后才能下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its speech line by line, and the sounds heard, into a text asset" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "逐行写出其中的话语和听到的声音，存为文本素材"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its turns run on this Mac's helper -- or on a fleet member's, as Offload Policies send Agent Turns: a Mac with the memory for the model, beside one with the GPU for the pictures. A member keeps the conversation in memory between turns, as long as set here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "它的回合在这台 Mac 的助手上运行——或者按照“分流策略”对“智能体回合”的设置，在机群成员的助手上运行：一台 Mac 提供模型所需的内存，另一台用 GPU 生成图片。成员在回合之间把对话保留在内存中，时长按这里的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its voice and its accompaniment, each into a sound of its own" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将其中的人声与伴奏分别存为独立的声音素材"
          }
        }
      }
    },
