            "value" : "要将此提示词保留在素材中吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept loaded, the next request starts at once instead of reading the whole model again. A generation that needs the memory unloads it first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "保持载入时，下一次请求会立即开始，无需重新读取整个模型。需要内存的生成会先将其卸载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
