    },
    "Run on Their Own" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "自动执行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running hot but still at full clock. A fanless Mac usually starts slowing down if the load continues." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "温度较高，但仍以全频运行。无风扇的 Mac 若持续负载，通常会开始降速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running now. Click the row to watch it on the stage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "正在运行。点按此行可在舞台上查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs attention's second product, P·V, in int8 as well: the product is kept in 32-bit integers across the key blocks, the probabilities on an 8-bit grid. For a clip, the first quarter of the steps keep SageAttention alone; a picture runs it on every step. On an M5 Ultra, a 1344×768 clip of 362 frames denoised about 8% sooner than with SageAttention alone (its attention 1.18×). Needs SageAttention; off in every Favor preset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "注意力的第二个乘积 P·V 也以 int8 计算：乘积在各键块之间以 32 位整数累加，概率落在 8 位网格上。片段的前四分之一步骤仍只用 SageAttention；图片则每一步都用。在 M5 Ultra 上，1344×768、362 帧的片段去噪比只用 SageAttention 快约 8%（注意力约 1.18 倍）。需要 SageAttention；所有偏好预设中均为关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs each block's feed-forward on the Apple Neural Engine at the same time as the GPU, its rows split between the two (fp16). Most worthwhile where the GPU has no int8 path (M4); the plan decides whether its module fits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每个块的前馈层与 GPU 同时在 Apple 神经网络引擎上运行，两者按行分担（fp16）。在 GPU 没有 int8 通路的机器（M4）上最有价值；能否放下由资源规划决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs here, never sent to a member." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "在本机运行，从不交给成员。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs here, unless this Mac cannot run it or is busy: then a free member that can." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "在本机运行；本机无法运行或正忙时，交给能运行的空闲成员。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs in place of the model's own (one at a time)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "替代模型自带的部件运行（一次一个）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on a free member that can, else here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "交给能运行的空闲成员；没有则在本机运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on a member only, never here: refused while none can take it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "只在成员上运行，从不在本机运行；没有成员能接手时会被拒绝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs the VAE's 3×3 convolutions and its attention's matrix products in int8 on the M5's matrix cores: the decode that makes the picture, and the encode of an edit's pictures. Each channel of a convolution's input gets a scale of its own. On an M5 Pro, a 1024×1024 picture decodes about 0.15-0.26 s sooner, 50-60 dB from the full-precision decode. Off in every Favor preset: the VAE is the last step before the pixels, with nothing after it to absorb an error." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "在 M5 的矩阵核心上以 int8 运行 VAE 的 3×3 卷积及其注意力的矩阵乘法：既用于生成画面的解码，也用于编辑时对图片的编码。卷积输入的每个通道各有自己的缩放。在 M5 Pro 上，一张 1024×1024 的图片解码约快 0.15-0.26 秒，与全精度解码相差 50-60 dB。所有偏好预设中均为关闭：VAE 是像素之前的最后一步，其后没有任何环节能吸收误差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sage"
