        }
      }
    },
    "Set an asset active to edit it. Drag it into the prompt to use it, onto the stage to place its layers in what is there, onto A or B under the stage to compare it, or onto a folder. A generation nothing uses any more is marked stale; it stays until you remove it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将素材设为当前即可编辑。拖入提示即可使用，拖到舞台上会把它的图层放进当前内容，拖到舞台下方的 A 或 B 上可进行对比，也可拖到文件夹中归类。不再被使用的生成结果会标记为过时，在你移除之前一直保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set an asset active to edit it. Drag it into the prompt to use it, onto the stage to place its layers in what is there, onto A or B under the stage to compare it, or onto a folder. A generation nothing uses any more is marked unused; it stays until you remove it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "将素材设为活动即可编辑。拖入提示词以使用它，拖到舞台上可将其图层放入当前内容，拖到舞台下方的 A 或 B 可进行比较，或拖到文件夹中。不再被使用的生成结果会标记为“未使用”，在你移除之前会一直保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set every option as a preset has it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
