            "value" : "拍摄时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking jobs now. While this Mac runs one for a member, its window is given over to it until the job ends." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "目前接受任务。这台 Mac 为成员运行任务时，其窗口将交由该任务使用，直到任务结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TaoMate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "TaoMate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TaoMate runs in its place" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "由 TaoMate 代替它运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TaoMate-H3's adapter run as an ordinary LoRA: 3 steps over the whole clip, at the shifts TaoMate's own schedule uses (video 12, audio 3). No soundtrack pass by the base model, no chunks and no cache, so no disk traffic, and a clip may open on a picture. Not the method the adapter was trained for: judge its results by eye." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "把 TaoMate-H3 的适配器当作普通 LoRA 使用：对整段视频跑 3 步，采用 TaoMate 自身调度所用的 shift（视频 12，音频 3）。不由基础模型单独生成音轨，不分块，也没有缓存，因此没有磁盘读写，视频也可以从一张图片开始。这并不是该适配器训练时所用的方法，请凭肉眼判断结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TaoMate-H3's streaming method, not a LoRA: the base model writes the soundtrack, then its adapter writes the video in chunks, 3 steps each, against a cache of the chunks before. It takes a LoRA slot in place of the Turbo LoRA. Words to a clip only, made in whole 5-second requests. That cache is kept on disk (in 8 bits with int8 GEMM) and read back a block at a time. An alternative to the Turbo LoRA: no Favor preset turns it on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "TaoMate-H3 的流式方法，而不是 LoRA：先由基础模型写出音轨，再由它的适配器分块写出视频，每块 3 步，并参照之前各块的缓存。它占用一个 LoRA 槽位，取代 Turbo LoRA。只能从文字生成片段，并以完整的 5 秒为单位生成。这份缓存存放在磁盘上（开启 int8 GEMM 时为 8 位），每次读回一个块。它是 Turbo LoRA 之外的另一种方法：没有哪个“偏好”预设会启用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasks still stopping after two minutes: the project closes without waiting for them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "两分钟后仍有任务未停止：项目将不再等待，直接关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell the agent more — it reads it at its next turn" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "再告诉智能体些什么——它会在下一轮读到"
