          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text to video" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "文生视频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ that has come down is deleted; downloading it again starts from the beginning." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "已下载的 %@ 将被删除；再次下载时会从头开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ that has come down so far is deleted. Pause it instead to go on later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "目前已下载的 %@ 将被删除。若想稍后接着下载，请改为暂停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@-bit copy is in use; the %@ original is kept beside it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The %1$@-bit copy is in use; the %2$@ original is kept beside it"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "正在使用 %@ 位副本；%@ 的原模型保留在旁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Agent tab over the prompt: ask for a deck, a poster or a video of your clips with music, and a model builds it in your document with the editor's tools, a step at a time. Switched off, the tab goes, and a session at work stops." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "提示词上方的“智能体”标签：请它做一份演示文稿、一张海报，或用你的视频片段配上音乐剪成一段视频，模型会用编辑器的工具在你的文稿中一步一步完成。关闭后，该标签会消失，正在进行的会话也会停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPU is busy but running below the clock it is rated for — steps take longer, and nothing in the generation is at fault. Better airflow under the Mac helps more than anything in software." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "GPU 正忙，但运行频率低于其额定频率——每一步耗时更长，这并非生成过程的问题。改善 Mac 底部的通风比任何软件设置都更有帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPU is idle, so its clock says nothing about throttling; showing the system thermal state instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "GPU 处于空闲，其频率无法说明是否降频；改为显示系统的热状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPU is running at its full clock." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "GPU 正以全频运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GPU's utilization, all apps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "GPU 利用率（所有应用）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Neural Engine, estimated from its power where the counter is live, else from how long its fabric sat above idle" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "神经网络引擎：在功耗计数可用时据功耗估算，否则据其总线高于空闲状态的时间估算"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Valtz Macs of this network as one: a job this Mac cannot run, or not now, goes to a member that can, and this Mac takes theirs when it is free." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "让此网络上的 Valtz Mac 协同工作：这台 Mac 无法运行或暂时无法运行的任务交给能运行的成员，空闲时它也接手其他成员的任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent's turns go to the provider: your requests, its steps and the names and words in the project. Pictures it looks at go too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "智能体的回合会发送给服务商：你的请求、它的步骤，以及项目中的名称和文字。它查看的图片也会发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent, at work on it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "正在处理它的智能体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The arithmetic Valtz achieves, in trillions of operations a second (TFLOP/s). The first figure and the bar in front: the GPU's. The second figure and the grey bar after it: the Neural Engine's. The last figure, the bar's full length: the highest the two have reached together since Valtz started. Counted as the models that report it count it: the picture and video models' transformers, not yet their decoders or text encoders." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Valtz 实际达到的运算量，单位为每秒万亿次运算（TFLOP/s）。第一个数字和前面的条：GPU 的。第二个数字和其后的灰色条：神经网络引擎的。最后一个数字，即条的全长：两者合计自 Valtz 启动以来达到的最高值。按报告它的模型的计数方式统计：图片和视频模型的 Transformer，尚不包括它们的解码器和文本编码器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clip is trimmed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "视频已修剪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The colour lines, outlines, text and the brush draw with" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "直线、轮廓、文字和画笔所用的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The compressed copy kept, its original deleted: %@ freed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "已保留压缩副本并删除原模型：腾出 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy's %@ is deleted. It can be compressed again later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "副本的 %@ 将被删除。之后可以再次压缩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The defaults are Med's: int8 GEMMs on an M5 or later, the rest off. An upscale already queued keeps what it was asked with; its recipe records them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "默认设置与“均衡”相同：在 M5 及更新的机型上开启 int8 GEMM，其余关闭。已排队的放大任务保持提交时的设置，并记录在其配方中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine here cannot compress models" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "此处的引擎无法压缩模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file as it is, nothing re-encoded" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "原样保存文件，不重新编码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first figure and the bar in front: the memory Valtz is using, models included (its footprint, as Activity Monitor shows it). The second figure and the grey bar behind it: the memory the whole Mac is using (Activity Monitor's Memory Used), of all it has." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "第一个数字和前面的条：Valtz 正在使用的内存，包括模型（它的内存占用，与“活动监视器”显示的一致）。第二个数字和后面的灰色条：整台 Mac 正在使用的内存（“活动监视器”中的“已使用内存”），占全部内存的多少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fleet's arithmetic: every member's GPU and Neural Engine TFLOP/s, this Mac's included, added up, of the highest the fleet has reached since Valtz started." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "舰队的运算量：每个成员（包括本机）的 GPU 和神经网络引擎 TFLOP/s 之和，以及自 Valtz 启动以来舰队达到的最高值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fleet: a discoverable member is reached by the others, who send it jobs. With the macOS firewall on, macOS asks whether Valtz may accept their connections the first time it listens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "舰队：可被发现的成员会被其他成员连接，并接收它们发来的任务。macOS 防火墙开启时，Valtz 第一次监听连接时 macOS 会询问是否允许它接受这些连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fleet: finding the other Valtz Macs of this network, and the fleets to join, and connecting to them (Settings › Fleet). macOS asks the first time Valtz looks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "舰队：查找此网络上的其他 Valtz Mac 和可加入的舰队，并与它们连接（设置 › 舰队）。Valtz 第一次查找时 macOS 会询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fleets whose members are discoverable on this network. Joining takes the fleet's secret." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "此网络上成员可被发现的舰队。加入需要舰队的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper reads a conversation up to its context. Auto gives it as much of the model’s own as this Mac’s memory holds, its words kept beside the model; less leaves more memory for the pictures. Past it, the agent compacts the conversation: the model writes notes on the work so far, and goes on from them and its latest turns. Switched off, a session stops there. For sessions started after a change; the Agent is in Settings › Experimental." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "助手读取的对话以其上下文为限。“自动”会在这台 Mac 的内存容得下的范围内给它尽量多的模型自身上下文，词元保存在模型旁；设得更小，则为图片留出更多内存。超过上下文时，智能体会压缩对话：模型为迄今的工作写下笔记，再从这些笔记和最近几轮继续。关闭后，会话会在那里停止。更改只对之后开始的会话生效；智能体位于“设置 › 实验性功能”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image was made and is in the project, but could not be shown: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "图像已生成并保存在项目中，但无法显示：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer's picture or clip restored at the size it is shown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "按显示尺寸修复放大图层中的图片或片段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The longest a player waits for a frame it can start from, seeking" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "跳转时播放器最长需要等待多久才能遇到可起播的帧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model Start runs -- the generation card's, one choice" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "“开始”运行的模型——与生成卡片中的选择相同"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model ends it, by %@ at most" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "由模型结束，最长 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model that writes prompts with you and reads what you ask for: which one, and how it runs." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
