    },
    "Under each of the agent's turns and each suggested prompt, in small type: the tokens it read (prefill) and wrote (decode), how fast, how many tokens a round of its drafter bought and how many of its drafts were kept, and how much of the conversation it went on from. The Agent is in Settings › Experimental." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "在智能体的每一轮和每条建议的提示词下方以小字显示：它读入（预填充）和写出（解码）的词元数、速度，草稿模型每轮换来多少词元、保留了多少草稿，以及沿用了多少已有对话。智能体位于“设置 › 实验性功能”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under each of the agent's turns, in small type: the tokens it read (prefill) and wrote (decode), how fast, and how much of the conversation it went on from. The Agent is in Settings › Experimental." : {
