    "Warm" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "偏热"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warming up. Fans (where present) have ramped; a fanless Mac may already be slowing down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "正在升温。风扇（如有）已加速；无风扇的 Mac 可能已开始降速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch a Clip" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "观看片段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Start makes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "“开始”要生成的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Valtz keeps on the internal SSD: models, projects and the cache, each sized." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Valtz 在内置 SSD 上存放的内容：模型、项目和缓存，各自的大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Valtz may ask macOS to use — the camera, the microphone, the Mac's sound, your folders — whether it is allowed now, and where Valtz needs it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Valtz 可能向 macOS 请求使用的内容——摄像头、麦克风、Mac 的声音、你的文件夹——当前是否已允许，以及 Valtz 在哪里需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What each model family makes on this Mac, and every resource it runs with: download it, or use it from where it already is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每个模型系列在这台 Mac 上能生成什么，以及它运行所需的每项资源：下载，或直接使用已有位置的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What exporting the project writes. Each asset keeps its own; clips at another rate are resampled to the project's." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "导出项目时使用的设置。每个素材保留自己的设置；其他帧率的片段会重新采样为项目的帧率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What has come down is deleted; downloading it again starts from the beginning." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "已下载的部分将被删除；再次下载时会从头开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What has come down so far is deleted. Pause it instead to go on later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "目前已下载的部分将被删除。若想稍后接着下载，请改为暂停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is still being built: switched on here to try it. It may change, or go." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "仍在开发中的功能：在这里打开即可试用。它们可能会改变，也可能被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it shows, scene by scene and as a whole, into a text asset" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "把视频内容逐个场景并整体概括，写成文本素材"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What rectangles and ellipses are filled with" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "矩形和椭圆的填充"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What rectangles, ellipses and polygons are filled with" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "矩形、椭圆和多边形的填充色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What rectangles, ellipses, polygons and closed curves are filled with" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "矩形、椭圆、多边形和闭合曲线的填充色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the Mac plays, recorded: the paperclip › Record Sound › From the System’s Audio, and a blank audio asset's Record with the system's audio as its source. Valtz records no picture of the screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "录制 Mac 播放的声音：回形针 › 录制声音 › 从系统音频，以及以系统音频为来源的空白音频素材的“录音”。Valtz 不会录制屏幕画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the speed adds" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "速度带来的变化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a generation finishes on a composition that has content" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "生成在已有内容的合成上完成时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the picture's centre is, across, in frame widths (+ right)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "图片中心的水平位置，以画面宽度计（正为向右）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the picture's centre is, down, in frame heights (+ down)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "图片中心的垂直位置，以画面高度计（正为向下）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the player is in the clip itself: its own time, not the timeline's" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "播放器在片段本身中的位置：片段自己的时间，而非时间线的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where this Mac's own jobs run, task by task and model by model; and what it offers the other members." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "本机自己的任务在哪里运行（按任务、按模型设置），以及本机向其他成员提供什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where this clip starts in the composition's timeline -- not a time in the clip. Type a timecode (00:00:01:12), a frame (#36) or seconds" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "此片段在合成时间线上的起点——不是片段内的时间。可输入时间码（00:00:01:12）、帧号（#36）或秒数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where this layer starts on the timeline: type a time" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "此图层在时间线上的起点：输入时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which int8 matrix product runs with int8 GEMM on. Accurate quantizes the weights and the activations in groups of 64 at every call. Fast keeps the block's weights as int8 in groups of 512, each group turned by a Hadamard rotation on both sides so that one large channel does not set its scale. Per Token gives each weight row and each token one scale across the whole product, after a rotation in blocks of 256: the fastest (Qwen-Image 2.1 on an M5: 1.4-1.7× Accurate). Per Token, Unrotated skips the rotation: a little faster again, its pictures further from the bf16 model's. Faster down the list, less exact. A full-precision model's blocks take it only while kept in memory: those it streams, on a smaller Mac, stay Accurate (an 8-bit compressed copy's take it either way). With ANE FFN on, it is Accurate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "int8 GEMM 开启时使用哪一种 int8 矩阵乘。精确：每次调用时把权重和激活都按 64 分组量化。快速：把块的权重以 int8 按 512 分组保存，每组在两侧都做一次 Hadamard 旋转，使单个较大的通道不会决定整组的尺度。逐 token：每个权重行和每个 token 在整个乘积上只取一个尺度，先按 256 分块旋转：最快（M5 上的 Qwen-Image 2.1：精确档的 1.4-1.7 倍）。逐 token，不旋转：省去旋转，再快一点，画面离 bf16 模型更远。越往下越快，精度越低。全精度模型的块只有留在内存中时才使用它：在内存较小的 Mac 上流式读取的块仍按精确档运行（8 位压缩副本的块两种情况下都使用）。开启 ANE FFN 时按精确档运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which of the VAE's convolutions run in int8 with VAE int8 on. Accurate takes those inside its residual blocks, whose inputs are normalized: about 1.15× the decode. Fast takes every 3×3 convolution, the upsampling ones too: about 1.26×, a little further from the full-precision picture." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "开启 VAE int8 时，哪些 VAE 卷积以 int8 运行。精确：残差块内的卷积，其输入已归一化，解码约 1.15×。快速：全部 3×3 卷积，包括上采样的卷积，约 1.26×，与全精度画面略有差距。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While it runs, this Mac's window is given over to it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "运行期间，这台 Mac 的窗口将交由该任务使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
